## ✅ `CustomerEmailFlow.flow` — built, validated, formatted

**File:** `CustomerEmailFlow/CustomerEmailFlow/CustomerEmailFlow.flow`

### What it does, end to end

```
📧 Email Received (Outlook trigger, polling)
       │
       ▼
   Triage: Urgent + VIP? (script node)
   Checks subject + body + sender for urgency/VIP signals
       │
       ▼
   Decision: Urgent AND VIP?
       │                    │
  ✅ TRUE                ❌ FALSE
  "Urgent + VIP"         "Everything Else"
       │                    │
       ▼                    ▼
Post VIP Alert         Create Support Ticket
to Slack (#general)    (deterministic ticket ID
       │                from email data)
       ▼                    │
Send VIP                    ▼
Acknowledgment         Send Ticket Reply
(Outlook reply)        (Outlook reply with ticket ID)
       │                    │
       ▼                    ▼
     End                   End
```

### Triage logic
- **Urgent keywords** in subject/body: `urgent`, `asap`, `critical`, `emergency`, `outage`, `down`, `immediately`, `p0`, `blocker`, `fire`, `high priority`, `sev1`, `severity 1`
- **VIP signals** in email content/sender: `vip`, `enterprise`, `premium`, `diamond`, `executive`, `priority customer`, `strategic account`, `key account`

### Connections wired
| Node | Connector | Connection |
|---|---|---|
| Email trigger | Microsoft Outlook 365 | `5af6fa90…` (your Inbox, folder key set) |
| Slack alert | Salesforce Slack | `849e85d8…` → `#general` (`C01G1P7CU58`) |
| VIP reply | Microsoft Outlook 365 | Same Outlook connection |
| Ticket reply | Microsoft Outlook 365 | Same Outlook connection |

